<title>NORWAY: Nera 9-month pre-tax profits dip.</title>
<headline>Nera 9-month pre-tax profits dip.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income				1,767     vs	 1,684</p>
<p> Research &amp; development		  147     vs	   115</p>
<p> Operating result			  111     vs	   117</p>
<p> Net financial items	    minus   21     vs  minus   20</p>
<p> Profit before tax			  90     vs	    97</p>
<p> Tax					    22     vs	    27</p>
<p> Profit after tax			   68     vs	    70</p>
<p>NOTE -  Full name of Norwegian telecommunications company is Nera ASA. A Reuter poll of six analysts forecast operating profits of 120 million crowns and a pre-tax result of 100 million crowns. Four of the analysts recommended a buy on the stock and two said sell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
